  "proposed_formula_review": {
    "formula": "For goal line0.5 only, pUnder=qUnder**((1-r)+r*R).",
    "algebra": "If qUnder=exp(-lambda), assume independent PP/nonPP Poisson components and scale only PP intensity by R.",
    "conditions": "r must be prior-only and in[0,1]; R nonnegative; R=1 preserves qUnder.",
    "risks": [
      "Paired market probability may already incorporate opponent matchup; adjustment can double-count information.",
      "Historical PP goal share is a noisy proxy for current role, not timely PP-unit assignment.",
      "Opponent goalie-observed PPshots/game mixes penalty frequency, killing ability, opponent offense and goalie-pull behavior.",
      "Keep UTA and ARI separate unless franchise continuity is expressly fixed before features; UTA has19prior games in this inspected cutoff.",
      "Latest prior team is causal metadata, but trades and long absences can make it stale; do not resolve team using target boxscore."
    ]
  },
  "limitations": [
    "All source publications are retrospective;72h is an availability assumption, not timestamped release proof.",
    "9valid team-games have opponent skater PPgoals exceeding goalie-observed PPgoals by1; compatible with omitted empty-net events but not event-classified here.",
    "Exact player_goals market settlement and quote availability remain a separate requirement.",
    "No outcomes from games at or after2024-11-23UTC were inspected; no predictions, price gaps, bets or returns were evaluated."
  ]
